      "text": "Learned counsel for the petitioners concedes that the issue involved in the present writ petition is squarely covered by a decision of the Supreme Court in Indore Development Authority Vs. Manohar Lal and others, AIR 2020 SC 1496, however, he prays for withdrawal of the petition as the petitioners want to file an application under Section 101(A) of the Right of Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation, and Resettlement Act, 2013.",
